      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Expected result: Show the filtered avatars in the \"Uploaded\" tab, on the website and in the VRChat Avatars SDK with black-yellow stripes too, perhaps with a checkbox to confirm \"show filtered\". These uploaded avatars can be switched into. Gating is applied to avatars uploaded/used by others as appropriate.\n\nActual result: Filtered avatars are not seen in Uploaded, VRChat Home and Content Manager, but are are seen in Recently Used and Favorite Avatars. These uploaded avatars can be switched into. Gating is applied to avatars uploaded/used by others as appropriate.\n\nThis expected result / proposed change doesn't hurt creator discoverability while it incentivizes keeping content tagged with warnings appropriately to reduce caused harm and subsequent moderation action.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
