      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The alternative for stifling creators is to use up Favorite Avatar slots for avatars they've uploaded with forced gating (Sexually Suggestive), which works but is not ideal either and creates unnecessary barriers for discoverability (especially with only 50 favorite avatar slots for users without VRC+).",
